{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MAL","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"玛拉基书","commonName":"玛拉基书","title":"玛拉基书","order":39,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"b8f03f2b63dae2e8ca7660b351ecba1ee8261284fa914942d9a20482cb2e47bd","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAL/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAL/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":55},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华的日子"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["“万军之耶和华说，‘那日要来临了，就像烧红的火炉，所有狂妄自大、作恶多端的人都要像碎秸一样被火烧尽。那将临之日必焚烧他们，使他们连根带枝荡然无存。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["但必有公义的太阳为你们这些敬畏我名的人升起，它的光芒有医治的能力。你们必像栏中出来的牛犊一样欢欣跳跃。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["到我所定的日子，你们必践踏恶人，他们必成为你们脚下的尘土。’这是万军之耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["“你们要铭记我仆人摩西的律法，就是我在何烈山借着他传给以色列人的律例和典章。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["“看啊，在耶和华那伟大而可畏的日子来临以前，我必差遣以利亚先知到你们那里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他必使父亲的心转向儿女，儿女的心转向父亲，免得我来彻底毁灭这地方。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAL/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAT/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/MAL/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}